<title>USA: FSA has capacity for Detroit convention center.</title>
<headline>FSA has capacity for Detroit convention center.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Monday it has remaining secondary market insurance capacity for Detroit, Mich., convention facility limited tax revenue refunding bonds, for Cobo Hall expansion project series 1993.</p>
<p>Capacity is limited and available on a first-come, first-served basis. For more information, call 212-826-0601.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
